+
+Export `createPatch(from, to)` from `src/index.ts`: returns a minimal-ish RFC 6902 JSON Patch that
+turns `from` into `to` via `applyPatch`. Objects diff per member (add/remove/replace, recursing);
+arrays trim the common prefix and suffix then diff the middle index-wise; differing types replace.
+Pointer tokens are escaped (`~0`, `~1`). Neither input is mutated and the patch shares no structure
+with them. Tests in `test/createpatch.test.mjs`.
